aC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"plan_defect","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RCA (rebar-debug fast path; sibling of 3d57/a3f5, same class).\n\nMECHANISM (confirmed at runtime on main containing a3f5's fix 37d29f017c88): delivered_children_manifest loops children through delivered_now -> _attested_delivered -> compute_validity('completion-verifier') per closed child; the completion branch's fingerprint recompute + 3 legacy retries + stale-material explanation = 5 full-store scans per stale child. Counting-seam RED test: 6 scans for 1 child vs 21 for 4 (identical slope to a3f5). a3f5's snapshot in completion_child_gate does NOT cover this call path — verified, not assumed.\n\nFIX: same remedy shape — 'with material_child_index(repo_root=repo_root):' around the delivered_now loop in orchestrator.delivered_children_manifest. GREEN: scans constant (wall clock 105s -> 9s for the suite); manifest membership unchanged (true-fingerprint child delivered, stale child not). Mutation check: fix reverted -> RED (21 vs 6), restored -> 47 passed across neighbor suites (test_delivered_now, test_completion_floor, test_completion_floor_e2e, test_completion_child_gate_scan_count).\n\nATTRIBUTION (independent — does NOT share a3f5's origin 929e): git log -S shows delivered_children_manifest and its per-child delivered_now loop were introduced by c19c8eb6a56 ('feat(plan-review): completion Pass-2 sub-call', 2026-07-02, pre-trailer; message cites Story 94fd, epic 66ac). delivered_now itself (3bf189f39a3, story tied-bulb-swoop) is O(1)-per-call; the O(N) full-store cost was born WITH the manifest loop, so the origin is the loop's story: 94fd-c930-9e69-497e (tow-amok-jug). Class: plan_defect — the site was born O(5N) (nothing later broke previously-fast behavior; unlike a3f5, which regressed a previously-light gate loop), the story's plan never accounted for the scan cost against live_material_children's documented light-read contract.","timestamp":1787453361860500001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"CLOSE EVIDENCE. Fix merged to main as dc2f8098962b7ccfeea43269556a48af2140c319 (Gerrit change 2143, 'Collapse per-child scans in delivered manifest'; LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, submitted by the operator poll). Plan review PASS, attestation signed at head dc2f8098962 (first sign attempts hit known bug a83f-6348 'sign fence compares store-wide tracker HEAD'; its fix 1a2b59ea91 landed mid-session and sign-review then persisted). All 3 ACs ticked: (1) scan count constant in child count — tests/unit/test_delivered_manifest_scan_count.py GREEN on merged main (RED pre-fix: 6 vs 21); (2) manifest membership unchanged — correctness guard GREEN; (3) make lint + make typecheck + complexity ratchet clean. Mutation check: fix reverted -> RED, restored -> 47 passed across neighbor suites. Closing --class=plan_defect --caused-by=94fd-c930-9e69-497e (tow-amok-jug; introducing commit c19c8eb6a56 — the site was born O(5N), independent of a3f5's origin 929e). Sibling sweep: this was the last known sibling of the 3d57/a3f5 class; a3f5's construct sweep found no others.","timestamp":1787457071339497001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1787443763836331001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0b25f7ed-2bc6-4093-afd6-840786e66a40","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"a3f5-5c19-faad-417b"},{"link_uuid":"6cf8e9b4-8393-46f9-b379-6f27ed14199f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"17da-6d07-3b60-4241"},{"link_uuid":"d1865898-f852-49a8-8dfb-a78a580b5388","provenance":"explicit","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"94fd-c930-9e69-497e"}],"description":"Sibling of bugs 3d57-602f-0b75-48ee and a3f5-5c19-faad-417b (found in a3f5's Step-7 construct sweep): the delivered-children manifest pays a full-store scan per child during Pass-2 completion sub-call assembly.\n\n## Mechanism\n\norchestrator.delivered_children_manifest (src/rebar/llm/plan_review/orchestrator.py) loops a container's children and calls attest.delivered_now -> _attested_delivered -> compute_validity(sig, child, 'completion-verifier') per closed child; the completion branch recomputes current_material_fingerprint (1 full-store reduce via relation_snapshot.live_material_children), a stale fingerprint retries 3 legacy generations (_legacy_material_ok), and explain_material_change enumerates once more — O(5N) full-store scans per manifest assembly (measured: 6 scans for 1 child, 21 for 4). a3f5's fix wrapped only completion_child_gate; this call path reaches the fingerprints OUTSIDE any snapshot (verified RED on main containing 37d29f017c88).\n\n## Fix\n\nSame remedy shape as 3d57 (14aa285f963) and a3f5 (37d29f017c88): open `with material_child_index(repo_root=repo_root):` around the delivered_now loop in delivered_children_manifest. One wide scan per assembly instead of O(5N); both snapshot and slow paths filter through counts_as_plan_material_child, so manifest membership is unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] Full-store reduce count during delivered_children_manifest does not grow with child count — proven by `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_delivered_manifest_scan_count.py::test_delivered_manifest_scan_count_constant_in_child_count` (RED before the fix: 6 vs 21 scans; GREEN after).\n- [x] Delivered manifest membership unchanged: a child attesting its true current fingerprint appears in the manifest, a stale child does not — proven by `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_delivered_manifest_scan_count.py` (correctness guard).\n- [x] `make lint` + `make typecheck` + complexity ratchet (`python scripts/check_complexity_baseline.py --check`) clean.\n\n## Testing\n\nRED-first counting-seam regression test tests/unit/test_delivered_manifest_scan_count.py (mirrors tests/unit/test_completion_child_gate_scan_count.py): monkeypatch-counts rebar._engine_support.reads.reduce_all_tickets, asserts scan count constant in child count, plus manifest-membership correctness guard. Mutation check: fix reverted returns the test to RED. Neighbor suites green (test_delivered_now, test_completion_floor, test_completion_floor_e2e, test_completion_child_gate_scan_count).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/orchestrator.py","reason":"open the shared material_child_index snapshot around the delivered_now loop in delivered_children_manifest"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_delivered_manifest_scan_count.py","reason":"scan-count regression test + manifest-membership correctness guard"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","17da-6d07-3b60-4241"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"40579d82-4fd0-41eb-a90e-afbbf9497084","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"bb3a-c931-47ba-4808","ticket_type":"bug","title":"delivered-children manifest scans full store per child (delivered_now)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["46aad7c1-564d-41dd-999d-3d2b5cc15561","0e66f9a5-3731-4ed6-a34d-cc49d171a08e","e57f3fef-08c1-4207-876e-0b5e45fa209a","24c62e94-ebfc-4c0e-9af5-a11b8db9819e","ea525885-2ded-4387-8edd-6ccba30235b1","6cf8e9b4-8393-46f9-b379-6f27ed14199f","a049e0ca-e4eb-457e-88fb-04324e646ce5","4c57b2c4-8ced-495d-87d8-6808c4d3feaf","0a57a4fc-4173-491f-a696-a0e041845e68","40579d82-4fd0-41eb-a90e-afbbf9497084","fe12db03-988c-49cb-be8b-4dbf9910c20e","d1865898-f852-49a8-8dfb-a78a580b5388"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787465287787642904,"uuid":"30c84a01-de91-45e6-a316-